## Common Mistakes to Avoid

| ❌ Don't | ✅ Do |
|----------|------|
| Return entity directly | Use mapper to convert to DTO |
| Inject repository in controller | Inject ClinicService (facade) |
| Forget `@PreAuthorize` | Add security annotation |
| Use wrong HTTP status codes | Follow standard conventions |
| Create DTOs manually | Generate from OpenAPI spec |
| Forget `@CrossOrigin` | Add for frontend compatibility |
